- % of budget provided through State funding for FSLA 
Target: State provides 80% of costs for system of FLA by end of project

Output 2 by 2023:
- Knowledge of judiciary on international fair trial standards increases
(disaggregated incl. by gender)
%. of cases which meet fair trial standards
- 1 complaint mechanism for S? via electronic means 

Output 3:
-By 2025 The structure is fully functional (at least 2 press secretary post established and funded by State by 100% in Ministry of Justice)
-# of legal awareness campaigns to be conducted by end of project in 2025
-Level of legal awareness of population by 2025 
a) overall legal awareness
b) awareness of legal aid

Output 4:
(Output 4: Civil society has the skills for evidence-based advocacy, participates in sustainable decisionmaking processes and follows-up and monitors implementation of those decisions) 
No. of studies, researches/ presented by CSOs at PD platform
Baseline: 0 Target: 2 studies undertaken during phase III
